-- Battle pets: only capturable species are wild battle pets (zrbfacore, 2026-11-07)
--
-- Found (Four): Lhara's display pets on Darkmoon Island (Darkmoon Cub, Turtle,
-- Zeppelin, Hatchling, Balloon) show the pet battle paw and can be battled.
--
-- Cause: when a creature of type 14 (wild pet) spawns, Map::AddBattlePet calls
-- WildBattlePetMgr::EnableWildBattle, which makes it a battleable wild pet if
-- battlepet_info has a row with that creature entry (NpcID). battlepet_info has a
-- row for every species, including companions you buy, win or get from a drop
-- and tamer team pets. So every spawned display pet next to a vendor or a tamer
-- became a wild battle pet: about 530 spawns of 375 entries in the world DB.
--
-- Changed: rows whose species is not capturable (BattlePetSpecies.Flags 0x8 not
-- set; flags from the 10.0.2 BattlePetSpecies.db2 CSV, 1,039 species) get
-- NpcID + 10000000. EnableWildBattle no longer finds them by creature entry, so
-- those spawns stay plain display pets. The rows themselves stay (the core reads
-- them by species for breed and quality when you learn a pet), so learned pets
-- are unchanged. Tamer battles use battlepet_npc_team_member, not this table.
-- Capturable species (Crow, Darkmoon Glowfly, every wild critter pet) are not touched.
--
-- Undo: UPDATE battlepet_info SET NpcID = NpcID - 10000000 WHERE NpcID >= 10000000;

